{"format_version": 2, "segments": [{"kind": "text", "text": " ἱστίον, τό ( Dim. of ἱστός in form only), web, cloth, sheet: hence in pl., hangings, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "LXX Ex. 27.9", "author_abbreviation": "LXX", "tlg_author": "0527", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "15", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0527", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; as a measure, piece, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "PRyl. 70.25", "author_abbreviation": "PRyl.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (ii B.C.); but, from "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hom.", "author_abbreviation": "Hom.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " downwds., sail, mostly in pl. ἱστία, ἕλκον δ' ἱστία λευκὰ . . βοεῦσιν they hauled them up with ox-hide ropes, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 2.426", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; τέταθ' ἱστία the sails were spread, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "11.11", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pi. N. 5.51", "author_abbreviation": "Pi.", "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἱστία στέλλεσθαι, μηρύεσθαι, καθελεῖν, to lower or furl sail (v. sub vocc.): "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "λύειν Od. 15.496", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἱστίοισι χρᾶσθαι Hdt. 4.110", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἄκροισι χρώμενος τοῖς ἱστίοις Ar. Ra. 1000", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "009", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": prov., πλήρεσιν ἱ. under full sail, with all one's might, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Philostr. VS 1.25.5", "author_abbreviation": "Philostr.", "tlg_author": "0638", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Suid.", "author_abbreviation": "Suid.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": rarely in sg., "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐν δ' ἄνεμος πρῆσεν μέσον ἱστίον Il. 1.481", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐξίει ἱ. ἀνεμόεν Pi. P. 1.92", "author_abbreviation": "Pi.", "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἱστίῳ καταπετάσαι τινά Pl. Prm. 131b", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "009", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "PMagd. 11.7", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (iii B.C.). "}]}